---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionTokenDistributor)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyProject
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_verifySupply: _verifyCanSupplyTokens(amount)
    q_verifySupply --> q_calcTotal: totalRequired = amount + legionFee + referrerFee
    q_calcTotal --> q_transferTokens: safeTransferFrom(msg.sender, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_transferTokens --> q_transferLegionFee: safeTransfer(legionFeeReceiver, legionFee)
    q_transferLegionFee --> q_transferReferrerFee: safeTransfer(referrerFeeDistributor, referrerFee)
    q_transferReferrerFee --> q_markSupplied: s_tokensSupplied = true
    q_markSupplied --> q_emit: emit TokensSuppliedForDistribution(amount, legionFee, referrerFee)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_verifySupply
        INV-001: Tokens can only be supplied once
        INV-002: Project must have approved sufficient token balance
    end note

    note right of q_calcTotal
        INV-003: Total = distribution amount + Legion fee + referrer fee
        INV-004: Fee tokens sent directly to receivers, not held in contract
    end note
